-- statement:
--   Under the actual original admissible capped dividend control, BV C1/UBV C2 regularity, w(0)>=0, HJB generator/gradient inequalities, q>0 and original right-continuous bounded ruin-stopped clock, the physical source mesh limit and eventual complete Stieltjes dividend upper domination, a.e. measurable terminal, centred integrable martingale and nonpositive integrable drift imply the full expected terminal-plus-cash and discounted dividend bounds. The complete real cash measurability is derived automatically from the original dividendMeasure kernel and IsStoppingTime using Proved rightcont cash bridge; it is no longer an independent hypothesis. Stochastic limits and terminal measurability remain explicit.
